  "$reapply_comment": [
    "Reapply/dedup corpus. 8-dim vectors in every embedding-bearing table (main:",
    "memories/vector_entries/conversation_chunks/help_docs; mount: doc_mount_chunks)",
    "so the Reapply Target profile (trunc=4) slices 8->4 across all of them. The",
    "dedup memories are 4-dim with crafted cosines: m-dup-a & m-dup-b >= 0.80",
    "(cluster), m-distinct < 0.80 (separate). The 8-dim and 4-dim memories form two",
    "dim groups, proving dedup never compares mismatched dims."
  ],
